            I got the CD to the "Philadelphia" soundtrack the other day and came up
with this for Indigo's "I Don't Want to Talk About It".  I think the
chords and lyrics are right but I didn't bother with a lot of details.
Listen to the CD - you'll figure it out.  Anyway...

